href="#sec-3.2.4">3.2.4 Firefox 147</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">34</span></div><div class="t t1"><a href="#sec-4">4 安全防护与无害性</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">36</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-4.1">4.1 有害请求评估</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">36</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.1.1">4.1.1 单轮有害请求评估结果</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">36</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.1.2">4.1.2 单轮良性请求评估结果</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">37</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.1.3">4.1.3 多轮测试结果</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">38</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.1.4">4.1.4 有害请求评估讨论</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">40</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-4.2">4.2 儿童安全评估</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">40</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-4.3">4.3 心理健康评估</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">43</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.3.1">4.3.1 自杀与自伤</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">43</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.3.2">4.3.2 进食紊乱</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">46</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-4.4">4.4 偏见与诚信评估</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">48</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.4.1">4.4.1 政治偏见与公允性</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">48</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.4.2">4.4.2 Bias Benchmark for Question Answering</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">50</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-4.4.3">4.4.3 选举诚信</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">52</span></div><div class="t t1"><a href="#sec-5">5 智能体安全</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">54</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-5.1">5.1 智能体的恶意使用</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">54</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-5.1.1">5.1.1 Claude Code 的恶意使用</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">54</span></div><div class="t t3"><