MO 2026</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">119</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-8.7">8.7 ArxivMath</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">120</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-8.8">8.8 ProgramBench</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">121</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-8.9">8.9 智能体搜索</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">122</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.9.1">8.9.1 HLE</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">122</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.9.2">8.9.2 BrowseComp</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">123</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-8.10">8.10 多模态</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">124</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.10.1">8.10.1 GDP.pdf</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">124</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.10.2">8.10.2 OSWorld-Verified</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">126</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.10.3">8.10.3 BenchCAD</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">127</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.10.4">8.10.4 ChartMuseum</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">128</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.10.5">8.10.5 CharXiv Reasoning</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">129</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-8.11">8.11 真实世界专业任务</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">131</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.11.1">8.11.1 OfficeQA</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">131</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.11.2">8.11.2 Real-World Finance V2</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">132</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.11.3">8.11.3 Legal Agent Benchmark</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">133</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.11.4">8.11.4 GDPval-AA v2</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">134</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-8.11.5">8.11.5 Toolathlon</a><span class="d"></s